    "en": {
      "trackName": "iwatchTicTacToe",
      "description": "Turn your Apple Watch into a pocket game console with this fast, colorful, and fully interactive Tic-Tac-Toe experience.\n\nPlay quick matches anytime with a smooth, watch-optimized interface, animated tiles, and glowing win highlights. Choose your own emoji or icon instead of the classic X and O to make every match feel personal and fun.\n\nPlay solo against a smart AI opponent or challenge a friend in two-player mode on the same device. With a clean neon style, simple controls, and instant restarts, it’s perfect for short breaks and casual competition.\n\nFeatures:\n• Apple Watch native gameplay\n• Player vs AI and Player vs Player modes\n• Custom symbol selection with emoji and icons\n• Animated tap glow and winning line highlights\n• Fast restart and home navigation\n• Clean, high-contrast watch UI for easy play\n\nQuick to learn, satisfying to master, and always ready on your wrist.",
